WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
Thank you guys so much.

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so excited
to be in New York City.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
This is amazing.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:08.908 size:75% position:38% line:92%
So great to be here.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:13.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
I actually just got back
from my high school reunion.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:14.547 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:19.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, they asked if
I wanted to perform at it.

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:24.791
I was like, "I would rather
strip at my family reunion...

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:34.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
...than tell jokes
to the girl who, during class,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:38.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
pierced her own belly button
with a stapler."

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.374 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, grew up in
a real meth-y area.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.515 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:52.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
My high school crush showed up
with a marijuana leaf

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.221 size:78% position:39% line:92%
tattooed on his face.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:57.924 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I was still in denial.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:02.462
I was like, "Well, someone's
not afraid of commitment."

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:10.904 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:13.339 line:92%
I come from some weird DNA.

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
My parents met playing
in a professional

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.678 size:75% position:38% line:92%
foosball tournament.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.813 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:23.149
So if you're embarrassed you met
your spouse on Tinder,

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.384 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
could be worse.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:30.890
Like, I literally wouldn't exist
if it weren't for foosball.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:33.526 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:35.228 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Which is sad.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:39.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
But some of you wouldn't exist
if weren't for boxed wine,

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.034 line:92%
so it's like yeah, whatever.

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
Gets weirder --
Not only is my dad

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:51.411
a pro foosball player, he's also
a slam poetry champion.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:54.614 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.417 line:92%
And an international yo-yo man.

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:00.753 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:04.491
Yeah, my dad has the sex appeal
of a fanny pack.

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:10.130 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm lucky, though, 'cause most
parents are disappointed

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
if their kid
becomes a comedian.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:20.006
But my circus-y parents are
like, "Wow, you did a show

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:22.642 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and they paid you $12?

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:27.213 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:29.082 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You're like a lawyer."

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:31.951 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.951 --> 00:02:34.187 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Didn't pass the bar.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys just set
the bar very low.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.659 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.360 size:78% position:39% line:92%
We're a nerdy family.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:44.030
Like, I have the deadly
peanut allergy, but some people

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
just think I'm on a diet
'cause last week I turned down

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
a peanut butter cookie
and the woman said,

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.505 line:92%
"Oh, come on, live a little."

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:58.278 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:01.247
I was like, "I'm actually trying
to live a lot."

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:05.218 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.719 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Not counting calories.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.288 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just dodging death.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:12.325 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:14.260 line:92%
I have so many allergies.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.862 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I'm allergic to latex.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:18.464 line:92%
Found that one out in a fun way.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:20.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:26.005 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohs ]

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
My biggest fear is
a peanut butter

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:30.510 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and condom sandwich.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:40.520 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.489 size:81% position:41%
And it's scary because
I'm actually allergic

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:46.793 line:92%
to most allergy medicines.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.260 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.463 size:88% position:44%
It's like Charles Darwin
just waving, "Bye, girl.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:55.068 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.736 size:78% position:39% line:92%
You ain't making it."

00:03:56.736 --> 00:03:57.804 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:57.804 --> 00:04:01.107 line:92%
I'm like the millennial mascot.

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
All millennials'
immune systems look like

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:05.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Charlie Brown
Christmas tree.

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:08.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.882 size:88% position:44% line:92%
All fragile and exposed.

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:13.820
Older generations aren't scared
of things like gluten.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.322 line:92%
Old people are made of toast.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:21.327 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.327 --> 00:04:24.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
My mom just told me that when
she was pregnant with me,

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:28.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
she only ate
instant mashed potatoes,

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:30.870 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Skittles, and doughnuts.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.272 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:32.272 --> 00:04:35.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Oh, that's why I'm broken."

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:39.145 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:42.782
I got coffee with a friend
recently and she told me

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she's trying
to be a better person.

00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:47.153
I was like, "Oh, that's nice.
What have you been doing?"

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:50.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "Well,
I'm taking less selfies."

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:54.327 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:57.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, take it easy,
Mother Theresa.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.965 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:58.965 --> 00:05:02.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
Save some of the Lord's work
for the rest of us.

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:05.772 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:08.174 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyone says we're
so self-absorbed now

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:12.845
with our selfies, but I think
we were way worse before then,

00:05:12.845 --> 00:05:15.515 size:78% position:39%
'cause at one point,
we were all in school

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:17.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we all had
school picture day.

00:05:17.417 --> 00:05:24.424
And then we ordered physical
copies of photos of ourselves,

00:05:24.424 --> 00:05:26.826 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and gave them to people.

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:35.068 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:38.404 line:92%
Like, narcissistic sociopaths.

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.005 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:43.042 size:78% position:39%
Can you imagine doing
that now as an adult?

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:46.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just going up to a
coworker unprompted like --

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:52.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:52.418 --> 00:05:53.920 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"I signed it."

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.555 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:55.555 --> 00:05:58.057 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Thank you guys so much.

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:01.194 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Music plays ]

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:02.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my goodness.

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:06.466 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:08.468 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Kelsey Cook, everybody!

00:06:08.468 --> 00:06:09.569 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:09.569 --> 00:06:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
